  "rating": {
    "inherent": "critical",
    "residual": "high",
    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "The agent takes untrusted inputs and can execute broad-scoped ERP bank updates and payments, presenting a critical inherent risk. The sole preventive control is a high-volume summary approval gate, yielding a residual risk of high. Under a model upgrade, the model could easily generate persuasive or deceptive summaries that exploit human trust and bypass the clerk's review entirely, restoring risk to critical."
